 460:libs/alglib/src/ap.h **** 
 461:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****     owner       ACT_DROP_ON_REALLOC or ACT_XFREE_ON_REALLOC. Determines what to do on realloc().
 462:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 If vector is owned by caller, X-interface  will  just set
 463:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 ptr to NULL before realloc(). If it is  owned  by  X,  it
 464:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 will call ae_free/x_free/aligned_free family functions.
 465:libs/alglib/src/ap.h **** 
 466:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****     last_action ACT_UNCHANGED, ACT_SAME_LOCATION, ACT_NEW_LOCATION
 467:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 contents is either: unchanged, stored at the same location,
 468:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 stored at the new location.
