 978:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****      * list of recycled ENTRIES:
 979:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****      * 1. this list holds entries which are not used to store recycled objects;
 980:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****      *    every time recycled object is retrieved, its entry is moved to this list.
 981:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****      * 2. every time object is recycled, we try to fetch entry for him from this list
 982:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****      *    before allocating it with malloc()
 983:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****      */
