  46:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** Cash-Karp adaptive ODE solver.
  47:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
  48:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** This subroutine solves ODE  Y'=f(Y,x)  with  initial  conditions  Y(xs)=Ys
  49:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** (here Y may be single variable or vector of N variables).
  50:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
  51:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS:
  52:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     Y       -   initial conditions, array[0..N-1].
  53:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 contains values of Y[] at X[0]
  54:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     N       -   system size
  55:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     X       -   points at which Y should be tabulated, array[0..M-1]
  56:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 integrations starts at X[0], ends at X[M-1],  intermediate
  57:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 values at X[i] are returned too.
  58:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 SHOULD BE ORDERED BY ASCENDING OR BY DESCENDING!
  59:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     M       -   number of intermediate points + first point + last point:
  60:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * M>2 means that you need both Y(X[M-1]) and M-2 values at
  61:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   intermediate points
  62:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * M=2 means that you want just to integrate from  X[0]  to
  63:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   X[1] and don't interested in intermediate values.
  64:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * M=1 means that you don't want to integrate :)
  65:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   it is degenerate case, but it will be handled correctly.
  66:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * M<1 means error
  67:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     Eps     -   tolerance (absolute/relative error on each  step  will  be
  68:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 less than Eps). When passing:
  69:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * Eps>0, it means desired ABSOLUTE error
  70:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * Eps<0, it means desired RELATIVE error.  Relative errors
  71:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   are calculated with respect to maximum values of  Y seen
  72:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   so far. Be careful to use this criterion  when  starting
  73:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   from Y[] that are close to zero.
  74:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     H       -   initial  step  lenth,  it  will  be adjusted automatically
  75:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 after the first  step.  If  H=0,  step  will  be  selected
  76:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 automatically  (usualy  it  will  be  equal  to  0.001  of
  77:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 min(x[i]-x[j])).
  78:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
  79:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS
  80:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     State   -   structure which stores algorithm state between  subsequent
  81:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 calls of OdeSolverIteration. Used for reverse communication.
  82:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 This structure should be passed  to the OdeSolverIteration
  83:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 subroutine.
  84:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
  85:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** SEE ALSO
  86:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     AutoGKSmoothW, AutoGKSingular, AutoGKIteration, AutoGKResults.
  87:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
  88:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
  89:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB --
  90:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****      Copyright 01.09.2009 by Bochkanov Sergey
