 130:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   intermediate points
 131:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * M=2 means that you want just to integrate from  X[0]  to
 132:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   X[1] and don't interested in intermediate values.
 133:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * M=1 means that you don't want to integrate :)
 134:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   it is degenerate case, but it will be handled correctly.
 135:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * M<1 means error
 136:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     Eps     -   tolerance (absolute/relative error on each  step  will  be
 137:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 less than Eps). When passing:
 138:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * Eps>0, it means desired ABSOLUTE error
 139:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 * Eps<0, it means desired RELATIVE error.  Relative errors
 140:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   are calculated with respect to maximum values of  Y seen
 141:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   so far. Be careful to use this criterion  when  starting
 142:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                   from Y[] that are close to zero.
 143:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     H       -   initial  step  lenth,  it  will  be adjusted automatically
 144:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 after the first  step.  If  H=0,  step  will  be  selected
 145:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 automatically  (usualy  it  will  be  equal  to  0.001  of
 146:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 min(x[i]-x[j])).
 147:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
 148:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS
 149:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****     State   -   structure which stores algorithm state between  subsequent
 150:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 calls of OdeSolverIteration. Used for reverse communication.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\cc6CrUBc.s 			page 71


 151:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 This structure should be passed  to the OdeSolverIteration
 152:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp ****                 subroutine.
 153:libs/alglib/src/diffequations.cpp **** 
